cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,10,10)\">Judg 10:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,8)\">1Sam 7:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:9\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,9)\">1Sam 7:9</ref> (+ <bdbheb>בעד</bdbheb> of intercession), <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:8\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,8)\">1Sam 12:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 12:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,12,10)\">1Sam 12:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 15:11\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(9,15,11)\">1Sam 15:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 3:4\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(33,3,4)\">Mic 3:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 11:11\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,11)\">Jer 11:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Hab 1:2\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,2)\">Hab 1:2</ref> (with accusative <bdbheb>חמס</bdbheb>, compare <ref ref=\"Hos 8:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,2)\">Hos 8:2</ref> below), <ref ref=\"2Chr 20:9\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(14,20,9)\">2Chr 20:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 22:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,6)\">Ps 22:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 107:13\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,13)\">Ps 107:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 107:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"107\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"107\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,107,19)\">Ps 107:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 142:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"142\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"142\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,142,6)\">Ps 142:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Joel 1:14\" b=\"29\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(29,1,14)\">Joel 1:14</ref> followed by <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶליֿ</bdbheb> + <bdbheb>בְּקוֺל גָּדוֺל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Neh 9:4\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,4)\">Neh 9:4</ref> + <bdbheb>קוֺלִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 142:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"142\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"142\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,142,2)\">Ps 142:2</ref> (|| <bdbheb>התחנן</bdbheb>); + <bdbheb>בְּלִבָּם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 7:14\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(28,7,14)\">Hos 7:14</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>הֵילִיל</bdbheb>); followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 8:2\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(28,8,2)\">Hos 8:2</ref> (+ object of words uttered), <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:20\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,20)\">1Chr 5:20</ref> followed by suffix <ref ref=\"Neh 9:28\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,28)\">Neh 9:28</ref> followed by <bdbheb>הַשָּׁמַיִם</bdbheb> (without divine name) <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:20\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,20)\">2Chr 32:20</ref> (|| <bdbheb>התפלל</bdbheb>); absolute, but with implication of cry to <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 8:18\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(9,8,18)\">1Sam 8:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 30:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,19)\">Isa 30:19</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> unto other gods, followed by <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 10:14\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(7,10,14)\">Judg 10:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 11:12\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(24,11,12)\">Jer 11:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jonah 1:5\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(32,1,5)\">Jonah 1:5</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> unto king, followed by <bdbheb>אֶלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:29\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,29)\">2Sam 19:29</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> absolute, utterance of horror, anxiety, alarm, distress, sorrow, etc. <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:13\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,13)\">1Sam 4:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 5:10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(9,5,10)\">1Sam 5:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 28:12\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(9,28,12)\">1Sam 28:12</ref> (+ <bdbheb>בקול גדול</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"2Sam 13:19\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(10,13,19)\">2Sam 13:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 19:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,19,5)\">2Sam 19:5</ref> (+ <bdbheb>קול גדול</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"1Kgs 22:32\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(11,22,32)\">1Kgs 22:32</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 18:31\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(14,18,31)\">2Chr 18:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 15:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,15,4)\">Isa 15:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 26:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,26,17)\">Isa 26:17</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 57:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"57\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"57\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,57,13)\">Isa 57:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 20:8\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(24,20,8)\">Jer 20:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>קרא</bdbheb>, compare <ref ref=\"Hab 1:2\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(35,1,2)\">Hab 1:2</ref> above), <ref ref=\"Lam 3:8\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,8)\">Lam 3:8</ref> (|| <bdbheb>אֲשַׁוֵּעַ</bdbheb>) <ref ref=\"Ezek 9:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,9,8)\">Ezek 9:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 11:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,11,13)\">Ezek 11:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 27:30\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(26,27,30)\">Ezek 27:30</ref> also of cry heard by God <ref ref=\"Exod 2:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,2,23)\">Exod 2:23</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); followed by <bdbheb>לְ</bdbheb> of that in behalf of, or for which one cries <ref ref=\"Isa 15:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,15,5)\">Isa 15:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 48:31\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,31)\">Jer 48:31</ref> so followed by <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 30:15\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(24,30,15)\">Jer 30:15</ref> followed by accusative of congnate meaning with verb <bdbheb>זְעָקָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 4:1\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(17,4,1)\">Esth 4:1</ref> || <bdbheb>היליל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 47:2\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"47\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"47\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(24,47,2)\">Jer 47:2</ref> and especially Imperative <ref ref=\"Isa 14:31\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(23,14,31)\">Isa 14:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 25:34\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,34)\">Jer 25:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 48:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,48,20)\">Jer 48:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:17\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,17)\">Ezek 21:17</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>e.</b> <highlight>cry out</highlight> against one, followed by <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 31:38\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,38)\">Job 31:38</ref> <highlight>if my land cry out against me</highlight> (|| <bdbheb>יִבְכָּיוּן</bdbheb>); compare also (absolute, and without preposition) <ref ref=\"Hab 2:11\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(35,2,11)\">Hab 2:11</ref> <highlight>the stone shall cry out of</highlight> (<bdbheb>מִן</bdbheb>) <highlight>the wall</highlight>. <b>Niph`al</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 2 masculine singular <bdbheb>נִזְעָ֑קְתָּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 18:23\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,23)\">Judg 18:23</ref> 3 masculine plural <bdbheb>נִזְעֲקוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 18:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,22)\">Judg 18:22</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיִּזָּעֵק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:34\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,34)\">Judg 6:34</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>וַיִּזָּעֲקוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 8:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,16)\">Josh 8:16</ref> — <highlight>be called together</highlight> </div><div class=\"remarks\"><b>**</b>= <highlight>be called out</highlight> for military service, passive of </div><div class=\"point\"><b>Hiph`il 1.</b>; compare GFM<sup><ref ref=\"Judg 18:28\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,28)\">Judg 18:28</ref></sup>; <highlight>assemble, join</highlight> <ref ref=\"Josh 8:16\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(6,8,16)\">Josh 8:16</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Judg 18:22\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,22)\">Judg 18:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 18:23\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(7,18,23)\">Judg 18:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:20\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,20)\">1Sam 14:20</ref> followed by <bdbheb>אַחֲרָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 6:34\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,34)\">Judg 6:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 6:35\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(7,6,35)\">Judg 6:35</ref> <highlight>assembled after him</highlight>, i.e. joined him as his followers. <b>Hiph`il</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וַיַּזְעֵק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 4:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,10)\">Judg 4:10</ref> + 3 t.; <bdbheb>יַזְעִיקוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 35:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,35,9)\">Job 35:9</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>הַזְעֶקֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,4)\">2Sam 20:4</ref> <highlight>Infinitive construct</highlight> <bdbheb>לְהַזְעִיק</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,5)\">2Sam 20:5</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>call, call out</highlight>, or <highlight>together</highlight>, for military service, followed by accusative <ref ref=\"Judg 4:10\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,10)\">Judg 4:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 4:13\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(7,4,13)\">Judg 4:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,4)\">2Sam 20:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:5\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,5)\">2Sam 20:5</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>make a crying</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 35:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,35,9)\">Job 35:9</ref> (<bdbheb>יְשַׁוְּעוּ</bdbheb> in || clause) </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>have proclamation made</highlight> <bdbheb>ויאמר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ויז</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jonah 3:7\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(32,3,7)\">Jonah 3:7</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>call out to, or at</highlight>, followed by accusative <bdbheb>וַיַּזְעֵק אֹתִי וַיְדַבֵּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Zech 6:8\" b=\"38\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(38,6,8)\">Zech 6:8</ref> (si vera lectio; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gr')\">Gr</lookup> queries <bdbheb>וַיָּעַר</bdbheb> ?). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Sam 13:19", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 13, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Ps 142:6", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 142, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "Judg 6:7", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 6, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Judg 11:11", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 11, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "1Sam 8:18", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 8, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "Isa 15:5", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 15, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "1Sam 7:9", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Ezek 21:17", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 21, "verse": 17}, {"raw": "Isa 14:31", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 14, "verse": 31}, {"raw": "Jer 48:20", "book": "JER", "chapter": 48, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Judg 10:14", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 10, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "1Sam 7:8", "book": "1SA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 8}, {"raw": "2Sam 19:29", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 19, "verse": 29}, {"raw": "Isa 30:19", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 30, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Isa 57:13", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 57, "verse": 13}, {"raw": "Judg 12